alor and skill and are often associated with the kukri, a machete that is curved forward, and is used both as a melee weapon or a cutting tool.","LocalizedString":"The 1st Gurkha Rifles, also known as The Malaun Regiment, was first formed in 1815 and has since then participated in many conflicts, including WWI and WWII, and is today a regiment of the Indian Army. During WWII the regiment grew from 2 to 5 battalions in size who all participated in fierce fighting against the Japanese forces, mostly in Malaya and Burma. The Gurkhas have a reputation for military valor and skill and are often associated with the kukri, a machete that is curved forward, and is used both as a melee weapon or a cutting tool."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Legions","isInPermanentPool":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardPlayedFromHand"],"hasGuard":true,"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'explosion_concrete_small'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Explosions_SFX/Wavs/explosion_concrete_small.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Britain/Invasion/t_indian_infantry_getty.t_indian_infantry_getty","SubPathString":""},"ImageAnchor":"EImageAnchor::Top","artist":"Getty Images","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/1st_Gurkha_Rifles.1st_Gurkha_Rifles","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":380.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_unit_1st_gurkha_rifles_photo","SourceString":"Gurkha infantry and tanks during the Battle of Imphal, 1944.","LocalizedString":"Gurkha infantry and tanks during the Battle of Imphal, 1944."},"blowUpExplosionNiagara":{"ObjectName":"NiagaraSystem'NS_ExplosionInfantryM'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Effects/Niagara/NS_ExplosionInfantryM.46"},"blowUpCameraShake":{"ObjectName":"BlueprintGeneratedClass'CameraShakeMedium_C'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/examples/GrenadePack/Bluepr